206-b23","segments":[{"en":"OxEC = Obli101100","zh":"OxEC = 歐比101100","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"OxEC = 歐比101100","kind":"prose"},{"en":"WHY IPv6?","source":"text","id":"p206-b24","segments":[{"en":"WHY IPv6?","zh":"為什麼是IPv6?","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"為什麼是IPv6?","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nThe MAIN REASON is that there are simply not enough IPv4 addresses available \n• \nThere are 2^32 IPv4 Addresses available (4,294,967,296) \n• \nWhen IPv4 was being designed 30 years ago, the creators had NO idea the Internet would be as \nlarge as today \n• \nVLSM, Private IPv4 ADDRESSES, and NAT have been used to conserve the use of IPv4 \nADDRESS SPACE.","source":"text","id":"p206-b25","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"The MAIN REASON is that there are simply not enough IPv4 addresses available","zh":"主要原因是IPv4地址不足","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"There are 2^32 IPv4 Addresses available (4,294,967,296)","zh":"Τㄇ2^32IPv 網際網路檔案館的存檔,存檔日期2013-10-02.4可用地址( E)4,294,967,296)","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"When IPv4 was being designed 30 years ago, the creators had NO idea the Internet would be as large as today","zh":"當IPv4在幾年前被設計30時,創造者們不知道網際網路會像今天這樣大","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"VLSM, Private IPv4 ADDRESSES, and NAT have been used to conserve the use of IPv4 ADDRESS SPACE.","zh":"VLSM,Private IPv4地址,以及NAT被用於儲存IPv4地址空間的使用.","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"•\n主要原因是IPv4地址不足\n•\nΤㄇ2^32IPv 網際網路檔案館的存檔,存檔日期2013-10-02.4可用地址( E)4,294,967,296)\n•\n當IPv4在幾年前被設計30時,創造者們不知道網際網路會像今天這樣大\n•\nVLSM,Private IPv4地址,以及NAT被用於儲存IPv4地址空間的使用.","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":207,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0207.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"o \nThese are short-term solutions, however. \n• \nThe LONG -TERM solution is IPv6 \n• \nIPv4 ADDRESS assignments are controlled by IANA (Internet Assigned Number Authority) \n• \nIANA distributes IPv4 ADDRESS space to various RIRs (Regional Internet Registries), which then \nassign them to companies that need them.","source":"text","id":"p207-b1","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"These are short-term solutions, however.","zh":"然而,這些是短期的解決辦法。","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"The LONG -TERM solution is IPv6","zh":"長期解決方案為IPv6","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"IPv4 ADDRESS assignments are controlled by IANA (Internet Assigned Number Authority)","zh":"IPv4地址任務由IANA控制(網際網路指定號碼管理局).","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"IANA distributes IPv4 ADDRESS space to various RIRs (Regional Internet Registries), which then assign them to companies that need them.","zh":"IANA將IPv4地址空間分配到各種RIR(區域網際網路註冊公司),然後由它們分配給需要這些地址的公司.","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"零 級\n然而,這些是短期的解決辦法。\n•\n長期解決方案為IPv6\n•\nIPv4地址任務由IANA控制(網際網路指定號碼管理局).\n•\nIANA將IPv4地址空間分配到各種RIR(區域網際網路註冊公司),然後由它們分配給需要這些地址的公司.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"AFRINIC","source":"image-ocr","id":"p207-b2","segments":[{"en":"AFRINIC","zh":"冷凍劑","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"冷凍劑","kind":"prose"},{"en":"APNIC","source":"image-ocr","id":"p207-b3","segments":[{"en":"APNIC","zh":"音響","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"音響","kind":"prose"},{"en":"ARIN","source":"image-ocr","id":"p207-b4","segments":[{"en":"ARIN","zh":"亞林","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"亞林","kind":"prose"},{"en":"LACNIC","source":"image-ocr","id":"p207-b5","segments":[{"en":"LACNIC","zh":"寬度","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"寬度","kind":"prose"},{"en":"RIPE NCC","source":"image-ocr","id":"p207-b6","segments":[{"en":"RIPE NCC","zh":"已熟ncc 時","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"已熟ncc 時","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nOn September 24th, 2015, ARIN declared exhaustion of the ARIN IPv4 address pool \n• \nOn August 21st, 2020, LACNIC announced that it had made its final IPv4 all