[{"en":".•/56","zh":".•/56","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":".•/56","kind":"code"},{"en":"(Each digit is 4 bits / each 4 digit block is 16 bits) \nREMEMBER : You can only remove the LEADING ZEROS !!! \n2001 : 0DB8 : 8B00 : 0001 : FB89 : 017B : 0020 : 0011 /93 \nBecause 93 lands in the middle of a 4 bit number, we need to convert the last digit to binary and borrow a \n“bit” from the first binary digit. \n:: 017 [B] :: B = 0d11 = 0b1011 = 0b1000 (the first digit is borrowed, the remainder become 0)","source":"text","id":"p209-b28","segments":[{"en":"(Each digit is 4 bits / each 4 digit block is 16 bits) REMEMBER : You can only remove the LEADING ZEROS !!!","zh":"(每個數字是:4位/ 每個4數字塊是16記住:你只能去掉領先的零!","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2},{"en":"2001 : 0DB8 : 8B00 : 0001 : FB89 : 017B : 0020 : 0011 /93","zh":"2001 : 0DB8 : 8B00 : 0001 : FB89 : 017B : 0020 : 0011 /93","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Because 93 lands in the middle of a 4 bit number, we need to convert the last digit to binary and borrow a “bit” from the first binary digit.","zh":"因為93在4位數中間著陸,我們需要將最後一個位數轉換為二進位制並借用第一個二進位制位數的\"位\".","method":"local-mt"},{"en":":: 017 [B] :: B = 0d11 = 0b1011 = 0b1000 (the first digit is borrowed, the remainder become 0)","zh":"* 017[B] * B = 0d 11 = 0b 1011 =0b1000(第一位是借入的,其餘改為0)","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"(每個數字是:4位/ 每個4數字塊是16記住:你只能去掉領先的零!\n2001 : 0DB8 : 8B00 : 0001 : FB89 : 017B : 0020 : 0011 /93\n因為93在4位數中間著陸,我們需要將最後一個位數轉換為二進位制並借用第一個二進位制位數的\"位\".\n* 017[B] * B = 0d 11 = 0b 1011 =0b1000(第一位是借入的,其餘改為0)","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":210,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0210.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"the (Pv6 prefix","source":"image-ocr","id":"p210-b1","segments":[{"en":"the (Pv6 prefix","zh":"(Pv6 字首)","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"(Pv6 字首)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Finding","source":"image-ocr","id":"p210-b2","segments":[{"en":"Finding","zh":"查詢","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"查詢","kind":"prose"},{"en":"84 88 92","source":"image-ocr","id":"p210-b3","segments":[{"en":"84 88 92","zh":"84 88 